This page is intended for a more '''technical discussion''' of the game mechanics. For instance, equations governing combat, how STA translates into HP, how the con color system scales with level. It is '''important that this information applies to EQLegends mechanics''', as opposed to Live mechanics, or EQEmu mechanics. Each topic can have a list of reference links which may or may not apply. 

